        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 37,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.797,
            0.849,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 苏州大学2007级研究生要成立一个特殊机构，专门研究一些棘手的和保密性很强的工作。最近接到了一个任务，需要培养出正常狗大小的小鼠----“狗鼠”，据说是为了战争需要，哎！我门得采用以下哪一种方案才有可能得到“狗鼠”？并阐明每一种方案可行与否的理由。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 38,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.854,
            0.673,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 39,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.854,
                0.417,
                0.868
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "A. Block programmed cell death"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 40,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.873,
                0.672,
                0.887
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "B. Overproduce growth factors, mitogens or survival factors"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 41,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.891,
                0.337,
                0.905
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "C. Block p53 function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
